## Cross-service integration

No API, JWT, or iframe changes. Client-side filter UI only; wire existing list API query params where available.

---

## Risks and open items

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Queue tabs vs panel | Move status into panel; remove tab row for consistency |
| Mobile panel width | Full-width panel on small screens (`max-w-sm` on `sm+`) |
| Media API lacks search param | Client-filter current page slice; document limitation |

---

## Final verification

```bash
npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit
npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root
npm run type-check -w email-root
npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root
npm run type-check -w media-root
```

---

## Constraints

- Use `FeaturePage` `actions` for `ListFilterTrigger` — not ad-hoc header rows.
- Reset pagination to page 1 on filter apply ([item-list-pagination.mdc](../../.cursor/rules/item-list-pagination.mdc)).
- Do not add inline full-width filter forms above lists.
